						<bool name="Disabled">false</bool>
						<Content name="LinkedSource"><null></null></Content>
						<string name="Name">INSTRUCTIONS, READ BEFORE EDITING</string>
						<ProtectedString name="Source">-- 1. Put the pants and shirt into the model named Costume 1. (make sure there are none in there before you do this)
-- 2. Rename Costume 1 to whatever you like.
-- 3. go into the button, open the clothing script, and on line 6, make sure in parentces it says whatever you renamed the model with the clothing. Do this for the Colors
-- script as well.
-- 4. Have fun with your new costume giver and please give credit to marafca for making it possible.
-- All scripting was done by marafca.</ProtectedString>
					</Properties>
				</Item>
